      "writtenOn": "2024-12-19T01:41:35Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": ". This either indicates a bug in the provider (e.g., responding twice to the same reserved offer, or updating the capabilities of a reserved offer), or multiple providers responding to the same offer (which can happen, but is not useful to the requesting app).\n\nIt seems reasonable that a provider should only respond to a reservation if it knows that it is the only provider that can create the reserved network. But I think that is something that providers would need to do, and is not something we can enforce here in any way.",
