      "message": "+1. Also - we need to ensure that an app without location permission cannot call reserveNetwork to get location-sensitive information back.\n\nAssuming whatever specifier is being used for the reservation correctly implements redaction, this code will redact the capabilities that we send in the callback, but the network will still be reserved. That might allow an app to see if a particular specifiers exists by filing a reservation and seeing if it gets onReserved.\n\nIn the particular case of L2CAP I don\u0027t think this can happen, but we should think about it.",
